flowchart TB
    X["Executor"] -->|"queue.write(event)"| W["Queue writer<br/>numbers the event (SSE id)"]
    W --> B["Broadcast channel<br/>256 events by default"]
    W --> P["Persistence channel"]
    P --> T["Task store<br/>task + event log"]
    B --> L["Live subscribers<br/>one SSE stream each"]
    B -. "reader fell behind" .-> G{"Can the log supply<br/>every missed event?"}
    T -. "read in pages of<br/>subscribe_replay_limit" .-> G
    G -- yes --> R["Catch up from the log,<br/>then back to live"]
    G -- no --> Z["One event: error frame<br/>streamLagged, stream ends"]
